### The relationships of the unit Sales, stored from both ends (run `npm run watch` first)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/org/Relationships?$filter=SourceId eq '50000002'&$select=Relationship,TargetType,TargetId

### Evaluation path O-S-P from the top unit: 9 objects
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/org/evaluate(startType='O',startId='50000001',path='O-S-P')

### The tree of the top unit
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/org/tree(startId='50000001')

### A new position of the model's own
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/org/Objects
Content-Type: application/json

< ./position.json

### It belongs to Sales: the pair B003 is stored with it
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/org/Relationships
Content-Type: application/json

< ./sales.json

### A second chief position of Sales: HTTP 400
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/org/Relationships
Content-Type: application/json

< ./second-chief.json

### A unit that would report to a unit below it: HTTP 400
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/org/Relationships
Content-Type: application/json

< ./loop.json

### An evaluation path of your own, then use it
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/org/EvaluationPaths
Content-Type: application/json

< ./new-path.json

###
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/org/evaluate(startType='O',startId='50000002',path='O-S-C')
